You’re right—I made them into little character cards. You meant the funny, blunt evolutionary shortcut:

* Gecko: grip like crazy, then unstick.
* Cheetah: run faster than everything, briefly.
* Camel: keep going with less water.
* Woodpecker: smash wood without smashing itself.
* Bat: fly in the dark by listening to echoes.
* Bombardier beetle: make a chemical weapon inside its own body.
* Archerfish: spit accurately enough to knock bugs out of the air.

The fun is how absurdly specific each one sounds when you reduce it to its edge.